b'i requested the following information with no response from the company:
Certified Mail: XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX 
XX/XX/XXXX 
XXXX XXXX 
XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXXKimball Tirey & St. John XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX 
RE: Account XXXX 
Dear Kimball Tirey & St. John, 
This letter is a request for information regarding the account listed above. At this time Im 
requesting the following documents: 
1. Documentation establishing your authority to collect on this account; 
2. The name and address of the current creditor; 
3. Documentation identifying the original creditor and original account number; 
4. An itemization of the amount allegedly owed; 
5. Complete account payment history; 
6. Copies of any notices sent to me regarding this account; 
7. Copies of any disputes received from me and the results of any investigations conducted; 
8. Documentation supporting the accuracy of any information furnished to any consumer 
reporting agency concerning this account. 
Please send the requested information within 14 business days. 
Sincerely, XXXX XXXX XXXX'

XXXX requested the following information from the company but they did not respond: 
Cert Mail: XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXXnExeter Finance, LLC. XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXXDear Exeter, 
This letter is a request for information regarding the account listed above. At this time 
Im requesting the following documents: 
1. Notification before Disposition of Collateral; 
2. Timeliness of Notification before Disposition of Collateral; 
3. Contents and Forms of Notification before Disposition of Collateral; 
4. Explanation of Calculation of Surplus or Deficiency; 
5. Copy of the Retail Installment Sales Contract; 
6. Account Payment History 
Please send the requested information within XXXX business days. 
Sincerely, XXXX XXXX XXXX
